    {
      "id": "claim_1734b0faafe54db9aaebe7e941768f46",
      "statement": "This repository has no CI job that runs the test suite: the only workflow is the wiki refresh, whose steps install the CLI and run `openwiki code --update --print` and never invoke pytest, so the documented `uv run pytest` command stays a manual gate and a red workflow run can only mean a failed or partial wiki generation.",
      "evidence": [
