        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_4643d6e408614a049ea39703083e27e6",
      "statement": "The workflow defines no `concurrency` group, so nothing serializes refresh runs: a manual `workflow_dispatch` can overlap the 08:00 UTC schedule and both runs target the same hardcoded `openwiki/update` branch.",
