    {
      "id": "claim_7d83803f1e3b4a639c89f3881b69c81a",
      "statement": "The CLI step runs in the checkout root with no `working-directory`, so the wiki is written to that directory's `openwiki/` folder — the same hardcoded directory name the service pins as `NATIVE_WIKI_DIR`, which is why `openwiki` is the first entry in the PR's `add-paths` whitelist.",
